  StyleBox["n", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "37f45561-2c62-ef44-b81f-73a9459bde8e"],
 " and check that the zone has converged."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->397213223,ExpressionUUID->"fcd16630-968f-f04a-b775-5fd54e7c1d64"]
}, Closed]],

